# D29, open question (TODO.md § Phase 1 › Défauts ouverts du cœur). A memory
# form (24 here) or an undefined command word (2): the core, like the corpus,
# takes the Line-F with the FPSR exception byte intact; the fork cleared it.
# [B] MC68881UM-1989 §2.3.3 (PDF p. 42) clears EXC "at the start of most
# operations", but no passage says whether that precedes the operand transfer
# the MC68030 aborts (MC68030UM-1989 §10.4.9, PDF p. 531), and §4.7.1.7
# (PDF p. 191) says only that an undefined command word takes an F-line
# exception. [F] Settled by a capture on a 68030 with a 68881/68882.
@OPEN D29 | fpuraw/off seed=721 #117
@OPEN D29 | fpuraw/off seed=721 #271
@OPEN D29 | fpuraw/off seed=721 #376
